{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>northward and southward and eastward and westward</b> — and to Jacob He said: westward and eastward and northward and southward. To Abraham He began by showing him the merit of the offerings, which are slaughtered in the north; and to Jacob He showed that through his merit they would cross the sea. And that is what is written: \"And Israel saw the great hand, etc.\" — old man Israel."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:16:02.151487901Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}